{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unsociable detective of the Police Department leads a quiet, uneventful life in a sleepy southern town. But everything changes when his superior assigns him to the case of two missing young people \u2014 a search that soon spirals into an inexplicable nightmare full of strange fads. Because the person who reported the disappearance... doesn\u2019t exist in any conventional sense of the word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aenigmarch\u00a0is a visual kinetic novel in the genre of a mystical thriller with elements of surrealism.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique, hand-crafted art</strong> \u2013 Every scene is drawn from scratch: no templates, no repeats \u2014 just rich, immersive environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch between noir and color modes</strong> \u2013 Experience the story in classic black-and-white or full color, depending on your mood.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3626350?t=1753870433","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3626350?t=1753870433","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626350/095a0450307af4071d248a3eb28dec08e3be9033/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753870433","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626350/095a0450307af4071d248a3eb28dec08e3be9033/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753870433","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains mature content, including partial female nudity (non-sexual), alcohol and tobacco use, and graphic depictions of death and violence. These elements are part of a serious narrative that explores themes such as loss, emotional instability, betrayal, and despair. Player discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unsociable detective of the Police Department leads a quiet, uneventful life in a sleepy southern town. But everything changes when his superior assigns him to the case of two missing young people \u2014 a search that soon spirals into an inexplicable nightmare full of strange fads. Because the person who reported the disappearance... doesn\u2019t exist in any conventional sense of the word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aenigmarch\u00a0is a visual kinetic novel in the genre of a mystical thriller with elements of surrealism.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique, hand-crafted art</strong> \u2013 Every scene is drawn from scratch: no templates, no repeats \u2014 just rich, immersive environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch between noir and color modes</strong> \u2013 Experience the story in classic black-and-white or full color, depending on your mood.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Alexander Vavilonsky","Chesnokov Aleksandr"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626350/e7068a6b7b9cd174a1f318a9a8087838357976c6/header.jpg?t=1753870433","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux distribution released after 2020<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 55